concept:australia-act-1986-sec-1 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "1 Termination of power of Parliament of United Kingdom to"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-1 ;
    values:originalText "legislate for Australia  No Act of the Parliament of the United Kingdom passed after the commencement of this Act shall extend, or be deemed to extend, to the Commonwealth, to a State or to a Territory as part of the law of the Commonwealth, of the State or of the Territory." ;
    skos:definition "legislate for Australia  No Act of the Parliament of the United Kingdom passed after the commencement of this Act shall extend, or be deemed to extend, to the Commonwealth, to a State or to a Territory as part of the law of the Commonwealth, of the State or of the Territory."@en ;
