doc:sec-11-ss-3 a cof:Section ;
    cof:title "11(3) Termination of appeals to Her Majesty in Council" ;
    values:kind "subsection" ;
    values:originalText "(3) The enactments referred to in subsection (2) (a) above are the following Acts of the Parliament of the United Kingdom or provisions of such Acts: The Australian Courts Act 1828, section 15 The Judicial Committee Act 1833 The Judicial Committee Act 1844 The Australian Constitutions Act 1850, section 28 The Colonial Courts of Admiralty Act 1890, section 6." ;
