    values:originalText "(2) Section 11A of the Principal Act is amended in subsection (3):  (a) by omitting from paragraph (a):  (i) “and Signet”; and  (ii) “constituted under Letters Patent under the Great Seal of the United Kingdom”; and  (b) by omitting from paragraph (b):  (i) “and Signet”; and  (ii) “whenever and so long as the office of Governor is vacant or the Governor is incapable of discharging the duties of administration or has departed from Queensland”." ;
    cof:pageNumber "10"^^xsd:integer .

concept:australia-act-1986-sec-13-ss-3 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "13(3) Amendment of Constitution Act of Queensland"@en ;
