    cof:title "16(3) Interpretation" ;
    values:kind "subsection" ;
    values:originalText "(3) A reference in this Act to the Parliament of a State includes, in relation to the State of New South Wales, a reference to the legislature of that State as constituted from time to time in accordance with the Constitution Act, 1902, or any other Act of that State, whether or not, in relation to any particular legislative act, the consent of the Legislative Council of that State is necessary." ;
    cof:pageNumber "12"^^xsd:integer .

